<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Jan unemployment rate rises to 2.4 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Jan unemployment rate rises to 2.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's unemployment rate in January rose to a seasonally-adjusted 2.4 percent from 1.9 percent a year earlier, provisional National Statistical Office (NSO) figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>						  Jan 97  Dec 96   Jan 96</p>
<p>    Unemployment (pct)			2.4     2.3	1.9</p>
<p>						   (2.6)   (2.3)    (2.1)</p>
<p>NOTE: Seasonally unadjusted figures in brackets. The NSO figures showed the economically active population was 20.95 million in January, compared with 20.29 million a year ago and 21.20 million in December. --Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5645</p>
</text>
